(6226236, 920432, 108069, '<td valign="top">David would be proud. Awesome. Extremely well done, beyond the obviously beautiful glass, to the glass-blowing cone peeking out to the mill company building to the back and of course the clouds. Composition is spot on perfect and the processing is as well. 10 from me.</td>', 'David would be proud. Awesome. Extremely well done, beyond the obviously beautiful glass, to the glass-blowing cone peeking out to the mill company building to the back and of course the clouds. Composition is spot on perfect and the processing is as well. 10 from me.', '2010-11-17 19:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6226237, 919267, 108069, '<td valign="top">Cool title, great capture. Well done.</td>', 'Cool title, great capture. Well done.', '2010-11-17 19:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6226244, 919755, 108069, '<td valign="top">Would work perfectly had the sunset been something a bit more interesting than the neighbor''s driveway. No offense... the idea is excellent, the execution is excellent (the reflection is perfect), it''s just the reflection subject that is lacking. Had you gone to a park overlooking (to reflect) the city and/or horizon and taken this same shot you''d be in the top ten. Well at least for me. As it is I give you a measly six and ask you to remember us here in crappy areas where we don''t have sun to take such shots. Don''t waste it.</td>', 'Would work perfectly had the sunset been something a bit more interesting than the neighbor''s driveway. No offense... the idea is excellent, the execution is excellent (the reflection is perfect), it''s just the reflection subject that is lacking. Had you gone to a park overlooking (to reflect) the city and/or horizon and taken this same shot you''d be in the top ten. Well at least for me. As it is I give you a measly six and ask you to remember us here in crappy areas where we don''t have sun to take such shots. Don''t waste it.', '2010-11-17 19:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
