(6226356, 920235, 114896, '<td valign="top">Very clear capture! You wonder if he''s looking at himself and just what he sees with all those eyes. Great lighting and background. Really shows off your subject.</td>', 'Very clear capture! You wonder if he''s looking at himself and just what he sees with all those eyes. Great lighting and background. Really shows off your subject.', '2010-11-17 19:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
