(6231775, 919925, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is something rather fictional and mysterious about this brilliant image.  It even stimulates the other senses, as I can hear the sounds of the swamp, and feel the moisture in the air.  Congrats on your front page finish.  Well-deserved.</td>', 'There is something rather fictional and mysterious about this brilliant image.  It even stimulates the other senses, as I can hear the sounds of the swamp, and feel the moisture in the air.  Congrats on your front page finish.  Well-deserved.', '2010-11-24 02:29:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231776, 920149, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is HYPER-real!!!  Congrats on your front page finish!</td>', 'This is HYPER-real!!!  Congrats on your front page finish!', '2010-11-24 02:30:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231777, 919989, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the double symmetry!!  Great image.</td>', 'I love the double symmetry!!  Great image.', '2010-11-24 02:30:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231778, 920488, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very cool shapes and colors.</td>', 'Very cool shapes and colors.', '2010-11-24 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231779, 920302, 96751, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of water, and terrific lighting.</td>', 'Excellent use of water, and terrific lighting.', '2010-11-24 02:31:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231781, 920461, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, Don.  This looks like a pastel, and the tones are rich and warm, inviting me to reach in and swirl my hands about in it.  Leaving out the "reflectees" leaves us wanting to know more, and perhaps catch a glimpse of immortals.</td>', 'Beautiful, Don.  This looks like a pastel, and the tones are rich and warm, inviting me to reach in and swirl my hands about in it.  Leaving out the "reflectees" leaves us wanting to know more, and perhaps catch a glimpse of immortals.', '2010-11-24 02:35:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231782, 920233, 96751, '<td valign="top">I really love the premise of this image, which as others have pointed out, has a lot of promise.  But God is in the details...  It would be worth trying it again.</td>', 'I really love the premise of this image, which as others have pointed out, has a lot of promise.  But God is in the details...  It would be worth trying it again.', '2010-11-24 02:36:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231784, 920314, 96751, '<td valign="top">Apparently, you and Don shoot in the same color palate.  And the same swamp...</td>', 'Apparently, you and Don shoot in the same color palate.  And the same swamp...', '2010-11-24 02:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231785, 920221, 96751, '<td valign="top">6.833 from commentors.  There IS an audience for your images :-)  Fabulous shot, and I love that I was there to witness your genius :-)</td>', '6.833 from commentors.  There IS an audience for your images :-)  Fabulous shot, and I love that I was there to witness your genius :-)', '2010-11-24 02:39:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231788, 920354, 96751, '<td valign="top">Endlessly intriguing, Robert.</td>', 'Endlessly intriguing, Robert.', '2010-11-24 02:40:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231789, 919960, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue.. Certainly worthy of a ribbon and whish to see the light sone day in th every distant future I suppose :( If Im lucky</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue.. Certainly worthy of a ribbon and whish to see the light sone day in th every distant future I suppose :( If Im lucky', '2010-11-24 02:40:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231790, 920119, 96751, '<td valign="top">Most excellent title, Lev.</td>', 'Most excellent title, Lev.', '2010-11-24 02:41:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231791, 920442, 96751, '<td valign="top">Such exquisite colors.</td>', 'Such exquisite colors.', '2010-11-24 02:42:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231798, 919267, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats Paul... I should have known these fish were yours!!! They deserve a ribbon each. Well executed</td>', 'Congrats Paul... I should have known these fish were yours!!! They deserve a ribbon each. Well executed', '2010-11-24 02:57:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231799, 920325, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon. I loved this image and note that even having turned it around it did very well.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon. I loved this image and note that even having turned it around it did very well.', '2010-11-24 02:58:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231820, 920462, 40391, '<td valign="top">This was my pick of the challenge. I could only find one shot close to this and gave you a 9.  I''m surprised it finished so low.</td>', 'This was my pick of the challenge. I could only find one shot close to this and gave you a 9.  I''m surprised it finished so low.', '2010-11-24 03:27:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231822, 920490, 40391, '<td valign="top">This was my second highest pick of the challenge(9) and I really appreciated your shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-11-24 03:36:24.</i></td>', 'This was my second highest pick of the challenge(9) and I really appreciated your shot.', '2010-11-24 03:30:06.000000', '2010-11-24 03:36:24.000000', 0),
(6231833, 920119, 60173, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> actually, I meant that the girl is looking at her own reflection (hence the title), but I guess this did not come across... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>To be honest I try to not read titles when voting, and apparently when I viewed this image I was very successful in that and completely missed it. Now that I see the title it does make a bit more sense. I think part of why the image didn''t convey that is because in the reflection her eyes almost look closed, or that she''s looking at the ad. The ad appears to be an important part of the image, so I tried to make a connection between the ad and the model. I think the same pose without anything in the window may have worked better, or a window where the object in the window wasn''t as obvious.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote, btw.</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: actually, I meant that the girl is looking at her own reflection (hence the title), but I guess this did not come across...   To be honest I try to not read titles when voting, and apparently when I viewed this image I was very successful in that and completely missed it. Now that I see the title it does make a bit more sense. I think part of why the image didn''t convey that is because in the reflection her eyes almost look closed, or that she''s looking at the ad. The ad appears to be an important part of the image, so I tried to make a connection between the ad and the model. I think the same pose without anything in the window may have worked better, or a window where the object in the window wasn''t as obvious. I didn''t vote, btw.', '2010-11-24 03:41:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231839, 919682, 86218, '<td valign="top">Remains one of my favourites in this challenge. Congrats on the 5th place</td>', 'Remains one of my favourites in this challenge. Congrats on the 5th place', '2010-11-24 03:47:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231850, 919267, 91360, '<td valign="top">great work!</td>', 'great work!', '2010-11-24 04:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231869, 919409, 64086, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done and processed. The texture of the sky, the leaves and the lines are fantastic. Both complex and serene.</td>', 'Beautifully done and processed. The texture of the sky, the leaves and the lines are fantastic. Both complex and serene.', '2010-11-24 05:41:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231873, 920345, 64086, '<td valign="top">Well done. Great photo. The layers of texture and light are beautiful .</td>', 'Well done. Great photo. The layers of texture and light are beautiful .', '2010-11-24 05:46:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231877, 920319, 64086, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen amything like it. The composition is so complex and works so well.</td>', 'I''ve never seen amything like it. The composition is so complex and works so well.', '2010-11-24 05:50:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6231880, 919570, 64086, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot.</td>', 'Amazing shot.', '2010-11-24 05:52:30.000000', NULL, 0),
